{"id": "EUVD-2026-102499", "enisaUuid": "d0a632ac-346d-3e81-a617-eaf83ad74efe", "description": "zhontai Admin.Core through 10.1.0 contains an authorization bypass vulnerability that allows authenticated users to ignore department DataScope restrictions by supplying out-of-scope record ids. Attackers holding user or organization module permissions with Dept or Self scope can call UserService and OrgService by-id methods to read, modify, disable, and delete users in other departments.", "datePublished": "2026-10-15T21:43:44", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-16T17:08:19", "baseScore": 5.3, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:L/AT:N/PR:L/UI:N/VC:L/VI:L/VA:L/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N", "references": ["https://hackmd.io/@hieuPenguinnn/zhontai-admin-core-by-id-missing-data-scope-cross-dept", "https://github.com/zhontai/Admin.Core/blob/v10.1.0/src/modules/admin/ZhonTai.Admin/Services/User/UserService.cs#L118-L144", "https://github.com/zhontai/Admin.Core/blob/v10.1.0/src/modules/admin/ZhonTai.Admin/Services/User/UserService.cs#L595-L636", "https://github.com/zhontai/Admin.Core/blob/v10.1.0/src/modules/admin/ZhonTai.Admin/Services/User/UserService.cs#L887-L900", "https://github.com/zhontai/Admin.Core/blob/v10.1.0/src/modules/admin/ZhonTai.Admin/Services/User/UserService.cs#L977-L1000", "https://github.com/zhontai/Admin.Core/blob/v10.1.0/src/modules/admin/ZhonTai.Admin/Services/Org/OrgService.cs#L64-L68", "https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/zhontai-admin-core-through-10.1.0-authorization-bypass-via-user-and-organization-by-id-endpoints"], "aliases": ["CVE-2026-111355", "GHSA-mq9g-xvh8-gxg3"], "assigner": "VulnCheck", "epss": 0.28, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "cdd3e239-82e3-3151-be4e-dc14026819e8", "product": {"name": "Admin.Core", "vendor": {"name": "zhontai"}}, "product_version": "0 \u226410.1.0"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "ae8f2684-c984-339d-a14b-53d92625045d", "vendor": {"name": "zhontai"}}], "isExploited": false}